WEBVTT

00:00:25.670 --> 00:00:28.970
Gobble!! Guts!! Gobble!! Guts!! Gobble!!

00:00:30.810 --> 00:00:34.210
Gobble!! Guts!! Gobble!! Guts!! Gobble!!

00:00:36.410 --> 00:00:39.050
Calling everything delicious!

00:00:39.050 --> 00:00:43.550
The more I eat, the more powerful I get!

00:00:44.120 --> 00:00:46.920
Let’s capture ingredients around the world!

00:00:46.920 --> 00:00:51.500
I dream of being an invincible 
Gourmet Fighter!!

00:00:51.760 --> 00:00:56.530
Now on to the bottom of the 
sea, or the tops of glaciers!

00:00:56.530 --> 00:00:59.200
Jump! Jump Jump Jump! 
Knock! Knock Knock Knock!

00:00:59.200 --> 00:01:01.400
Give thanks!

00:01:01.400 --> 00:01:04.610
Let’s eat!

00:01:05.040 --> 00:01:10.410
Wow wo!! Spiked Punch! Wow wo!! Multi-fold!

00:01:10.410 --> 00:01:15.550
Guts! Gutsy Guts! I can eat any dream!

00:01:15.550 --> 00:01:20.820
Wow wo!! My very own... 
Wow wo!! ...Full Course!

00:01:21.090 --> 00:01:24.990
Guts! Gutsy Guts! Gather them all up!

00:01:24.990 --> 00:01:31.070
And put the world on my plate!

00:01:31.070 --> 00:01:33.870
Wow wow wow! Eat the mountains!!

00:01:33.870 --> 00:01:36.440
Wow wow wow! Toriko!!

00:01:36.440 --> 00:01:39.040
Wow wow wow! Eat the oceans!!

00:01:39.040 --> 00:01:43.310
Wow wow wow! Tori, Tori, Tori, Toriko!!

00:01:46.010 --> 00:01:48.780
Someone once said:

00:01:49.450 --> 00:01:51.920
From the beautiful flower of a winter cherry

00:01:51.920 --> 00:01:58.830
grows wonderfully chewy and ever so 
slightly sweetened millet dumplings...

00:01:58.830 --> 00:02:02.900
The Winter Cherry Dumpling!

00:02:06.430 --> 00:02:10.300
There are camels whose humps 
are made of rich, sweet,

00:02:10.300 --> 00:02:13.570
double-sized scoops of vanilla ice cream...

00:02:13.570 --> 00:02:16.980
The Vanillamel!

00:02:17.380 --> 00:02:20.150
The world is in the Gourmet Age!

00:02:20.150 --> 00:02:24.750
An age in which people quest for 
yet unknown culinary delights!

00:02:27.290 --> 00:02:30.160
Toriko and the others arrived 
at the healing country, Life.

00:02:30.160 --> 00:02:34.130
They experienced all the strange and 
wonderful treatments available there.

00:02:35.500 --> 00:02:38.000
At the same time, Sunny came to Life

00:02:38.000 --> 00:02:41.630
in order to find Teppei's master, 
the Gourmet Reviver, Yosaku.

00:02:42.840 --> 00:02:46.010
Elsewhere, Komatsu returned to Hotel Gourmet,

00:02:46.010 --> 00:02:48.880
and began to recreate the Century Soup.

00:02:49.740 --> 00:02:53.680
Then, Match and the others 
were treated by Yosaku.

00:02:54.250 --> 00:02:58.680
Yosaku recognized Takimaru's 
spirit, and gave him the medicine.

00:02:59.320 --> 00:03:04.260
However, he said that healing 
Toriko's arm would take 20 years!

00:03:05.990 --> 00:03:10.860
Race to Finish! Will it Be Toriko's 
Recovery, or Komatsu's Soup?!

00:03:17.940 --> 00:03:21.570
When Komatsu finishes his soup, 
let's all eat it together.

00:03:21.570 --> 00:03:22.310
Yes.

00:03:22.570 --> 00:03:25.210
I'll be waiting, but I'm not expecting much.

00:03:25.210 --> 00:03:27.150
Toriko-san, please do your best as well.

00:03:27.150 --> 00:03:28.080
20 years...

00:03:28.850 --> 00:03:30.780
20 years, huh?

00:03:31.180 --> 00:03:32.320
Later!

00:03:33.380 --> 00:03:36.290
You there! Go bring me a ton of food!

00:03:36.290 --> 00:03:38.060
Huh? Why?

00:03:38.060 --> 00:03:39.920
Whatever, just hurry and do it!

00:03:42.430 --> 00:03:45.800
Now, Toriko, let's get 
started with the treatment.

00:03:47.460 --> 00:03:50.330
But, will it really take 20 years?

00:03:50.570 --> 00:03:54.770
Gourmet Cells are all-powerful cells 
that specialize in regeneration.

00:03:55.040 --> 00:03:58.840
But healing an entire arm 
isn't going to be that simple.

00:04:02.050 --> 00:04:03.110
Hey, what...

00:04:03.110 --> 00:04:04.380
What do you think you're doing?

00:04:04.380 --> 00:04:06.350
I need your DNA!

00:04:06.680 --> 00:04:07.680
A lot of it!

00:04:10.190 --> 00:04:11.420
Stop it! Hey!

00:04:15.290 --> 00:04:17.490
A Regeneration Seed.

00:04:17.490 --> 00:04:19.960
This guy is a seed that grows into a flower

00:04:19.960 --> 00:04:21.960
using the information of 
your DNA as nourishment.

00:04:21.960 --> 00:04:27.370
But without enough of the 
DNA's info, it won't bloom.

00:04:28.000 --> 00:04:31.110
And that's why you needed all that hair?

00:04:42.550 --> 00:04:44.550
Ooh, it sprouted!

00:04:47.120 --> 00:04:48.490
It bloomed!

00:04:48.490 --> 00:04:49.760
Don't get so excited.

00:04:49.760 --> 00:04:51.490
That's just the first step.

00:04:51.760 --> 00:04:55.130
Look at the seed that's in 
the center of the flower.

00:04:55.130 --> 00:04:57.530
All the information about 
you is contained within it.

00:04:57.530 --> 00:04:59.230
Including the info about your left arm.

00:04:59.500 --> 00:05:01.740
I'll plant that inside you.

00:05:01.740 --> 00:05:05.210
It's fragile like a soap bubble, 
so you gotta be careful.

00:05:07.340 --> 00:05:11.410
It's quite rare... If it 
breaks, that's pretty much it.

00:05:28.700 --> 00:05:29.330
My bad.

00:05:29.330 --> 00:05:31.000
What are you doing?!

00:05:31.000 --> 00:05:32.470
Don't worry!

00:05:32.470 --> 00:05:35.400
They say that mistakes are the friends 
of the mother of success, right?

00:05:35.400 --> 00:05:38.110
Friends of the mothers? That's 
not even blood-related!

00:05:38.110 --> 00:05:39.810
And that was a dumb mistake!

00:05:39.810 --> 00:05:41.270
You're gonna try it again, right?!

00:05:42.410 --> 00:05:46.080
More DNA! Shave off all 
the hair on your body!

00:06:04.030 --> 00:06:05.930
Y-Yes!

00:06:07.600 --> 00:06:10.200
Okay, now it really begins.

00:06:10.200 --> 00:06:12.840
Go soak in the Healing Jelly 
and cover the wound completely.

00:06:17.040 --> 00:06:19.080
Okay, let's do this!

00:06:22.550 --> 00:06:26.490
Chef Komatsu has finally started 
creating the Century Soup!

00:06:26.750 --> 00:06:28.620
Can he really recreate the taste of a soup

00:06:28.620 --> 00:06:30.420
that only appears once every 100 years?!

00:06:34.560 --> 00:06:37.200
Oh, you can't come into the kitchen.

00:06:38.200 --> 00:06:40.900
I'm sorry, but I have to concentrate.

00:06:43.370 --> 00:06:44.500
Sorry...

00:06:44.900 --> 00:06:48.570
I'll start by making a basic stock.

00:06:48.570 --> 00:06:51.140
Then I'll work from there, 
combining various ingredients.

00:06:51.140 --> 00:06:53.480
I'll use the bones of an 
Anmitsu Bird as the base,

00:06:53.480 --> 00:06:55.580
and boil them thoroughly under low heat with

00:06:55.580 --> 00:06:58.280
Plum Onions, Gold Carrots, and Cubed Pepper.

00:07:06.220 --> 00:07:07.990
Yes, this is good!

00:07:07.990 --> 00:07:10.330
Let's try adding in some shellfish flavor.

00:07:10.330 --> 00:07:15.900
Add in Matsutake Shells, Smoked Clam, 
Milk Scallops, and Rainbow Clams...

00:07:18.440 --> 00:07:19.970
Delicious!

00:07:19.970 --> 00:07:21.200
But wrong.

00:07:21.200 --> 00:07:23.670
The Century Soup was far different than this.

00:07:24.010 --> 00:07:26.110
Let's try supporting the 
flavor with seasonings.

00:07:28.550 --> 00:07:32.380
Add Sushi Salt and Seven Flavor Sake...

00:07:35.850 --> 00:07:38.220
Yum, delicious!

00:07:38.590 --> 00:07:41.160
But it's definitely totally wrong.

00:07:41.160 --> 00:07:43.830
The Century Soup had much 
more substance to it!

00:07:43.830 --> 00:07:46.630
Most importantly, it had an 
entirely different level of depth!

00:07:46.630 --> 00:07:50.330
This is definitely not going to 
be a problem that's easy to solve.

00:07:53.870 --> 00:07:55.870
Oh, you can't!

00:07:57.110 --> 00:07:58.740
You're hungry?

00:07:59.940 --> 00:08:02.840
Now that I think about it, 
I haven't eaten anything...

00:08:03.380 --> 00:08:05.750
Maybe I'll hang it up for today.

00:08:06.280 --> 00:08:10.320
But I'll definitely recreate 
it! The Century Soup!

00:08:12.090 --> 00:08:14.420
Waiting 20 years, huh?

00:08:14.420 --> 00:08:16.730
And I can't believe you 
did this to my hair...

00:08:16.730 --> 00:08:17.830
We're back!

00:08:17.830 --> 00:08:19.730
And we've brought food!

00:08:23.530 --> 00:08:25.530
What's with the hair?

00:08:25.530 --> 00:08:28.340
You look terrible! Not beautiful at all!

00:08:28.340 --> 00:08:30.400
Shut up, you! Leave me alone!

00:08:30.400 --> 00:08:33.210
That hairstyle's wild... It totally works!

00:08:33.210 --> 00:08:36.610
Toriko. From now on, your job will be to eat.

00:08:37.280 --> 00:08:41.550
That seed will grow by sucking 
up nutrients from your body.

00:08:41.550 --> 00:08:43.980
If it doesn't have enough, it won't grow.

00:08:43.980 --> 00:08:48.190
And if you're not careful... you'll die.

00:08:48.490 --> 00:08:50.660
My job's eating?

00:08:52.590 --> 00:08:55.230
Now that's a job that sounds like fun!

00:08:59.100 --> 00:09:00.270
Toriko?!

00:09:00.670 --> 00:09:01.470
So fast!

00:09:04.040 --> 00:09:05.910
Eat, Toriko!

00:09:10.740 --> 00:09:14.710
T-Thanks for the f-food...

00:09:26.860 --> 00:09:28.290
Impossible!

00:09:28.630 --> 00:09:30.900
A bud has already formed on his arm!

00:09:30.900 --> 00:09:33.400
Normally that'd take a year, at least!

00:09:33.930 --> 00:09:35.370
Crap, I'm gonna die!

00:09:35.370 --> 00:09:36.640
Bring me more!

00:09:36.640 --> 00:09:39.570
Toriko... Your Gourmet Cells are...

00:09:41.410 --> 00:09:44.710
Spiny Eel... I can get an 
awesome stock from this!

00:09:45.480 --> 00:09:47.780
It's been three weeks since 
he started making the soup.

00:09:48.050 --> 00:09:51.250
Chef Komatsu continues 
working around the clock...

00:09:52.350 --> 00:09:56.050
If I add Misty Shiitake 
Mushrooms to this Steak Kelp

00:09:56.050 --> 00:09:58.120
and Chuck Sardines I've soaked 
in water for one week...

00:09:58.120 --> 00:10:01.330
Also try adding Tuna Pig 
cutlet, smoked Ham Mackerel,

00:10:01.330 --> 00:10:04.260
Vanilla Garlic, and Peach Lemon peel...

00:10:13.800 --> 00:10:17.040
Not right... Maybe I don't 
need the Vanilla Garlic.

00:10:16.570 --> 00:10:17.880
Break Room

00:10:18.740 --> 00:10:20.780
Komatsu-kun, how's it going?

00:10:21.410 --> 00:10:24.210
It doesn't seem like I'm 
anywhere near completing it...

00:10:26.320 --> 00:10:28.520
You came here to cheer me up?

00:10:30.350 --> 00:10:31.460
Thank you.

00:10:35.390 --> 00:10:39.630
I'll definitely perfect that 
soup, born in your homeland.

00:10:41.430 --> 00:10:43.630
You're even drooling!

00:10:43.630 --> 00:10:45.540
I guess you want to drink 
it real soon too, huh?

00:10:49.910 --> 00:10:51.870
Must eat more!

00:10:51.870 --> 00:10:53.140
Hurry!

00:10:53.140 --> 00:10:55.180
Food! Bring more food!

00:10:55.180 --> 00:10:56.850
F-Food!

00:11:03.520 --> 00:11:07.160
It's not even close to 
Setsuno-san's Century Soup.

00:11:09.190 --> 00:11:11.090
It's been three months now since Chef Komatsu

00:11:11.090 --> 00:11:13.230
has started creating the Century Soup.

00:11:13.230 --> 00:11:16.200
Chef Komatsu has continued 
his work without rest.

00:11:16.930 --> 00:11:20.770
What made Setsuno-san's soup so 
amazing were the ingredients.

00:11:21.300 --> 00:11:25.540
They were all things only 
discovered in the past 100 years.

00:11:25.870 --> 00:11:29.610
Recreating the ancient flavors 
with today's ingredients...

00:11:29.610 --> 00:11:33.050
It comes from the respect to our forebears

00:11:33.050 --> 00:11:36.080
and the pride of the chefs of today.

00:11:37.050 --> 00:11:41.890
Setsuno-san most definitely 
made a soup of this century.

00:11:41.890 --> 00:11:45.190
I'm also going to make a 
Century Soup of this century,

00:11:45.190 --> 00:11:48.060
with today's ingredients, for sure!

00:11:48.060 --> 00:11:50.660
Well, easy to say, but how?

00:11:57.640 --> 00:11:59.610
Setsuno-san, good evening.

00:11:59.610 --> 00:12:03.640
I figured you'd be coming 
by soon, Komatsu-kun.

00:12:15.490 --> 00:12:18.690
This is how far I've come in making the soup.

00:12:18.690 --> 00:12:20.990
Would you try tasting it, Setsuno-san?

00:12:20.990 --> 00:12:24.830
You young people always want to 
find the answers so quickly...

00:12:24.830 --> 00:12:27.100
I-I'm sorry...

00:12:27.100 --> 00:12:33.510
Setsuno-san, about how many days did it 
take you to complete your Century Soup?

00:12:36.580 --> 00:12:38.010
Let me see...

00:12:38.010 --> 00:12:39.550
About...

00:12:39.550 --> 00:12:41.850
...30 years, I suppose?

00:12:41.850 --> 00:12:43.550
Oh?

00:12:43.550 --> 00:12:45.920
3-30 years?!

00:12:46.820 --> 00:12:50.720
If it took you 30 years, then 
how many years will it take me?!

00:12:51.520 --> 00:12:53.530
Then, let's have a taste.

00:12:55.690 --> 00:12:57.600
T-This is...

00:12:59.300 --> 00:13:03.940
But seriously... I've watched the master's 
revival treatments for a long time,

00:13:03.940 --> 00:13:07.110
but I've never seen anyone 
recover this quickly.

00:13:07.110 --> 00:13:08.570
As expected from you, Toriko.

00:13:08.570 --> 00:13:11.240
No matter how much I eat, I'm never full!

00:13:11.240 --> 00:13:14.710
It feels like all the nutrients 
are just sucked right out of me!

00:13:14.710 --> 00:13:15.610
But yeah...

00:13:15.610 --> 00:13:17.280
Who would have thought

00:13:17.280 --> 00:13:21.390
such a mystical thing as this Regeneration 
Seed would exist in nature?

00:13:21.390 --> 00:13:24.520
No, that seed is the original 
creation of my master.

00:13:24.520 --> 00:13:25.260
Huh?

00:13:25.260 --> 00:13:30.190
There are countless organisms in 
nature with regenerative ability...

00:13:30.190 --> 00:13:32.360
But nothing as special as this.

00:13:32.360 --> 00:13:34.930
Only the master knows how to create them.

00:13:37.130 --> 00:13:41.410
Amazing. This is the first time 
I really respect the old man.

00:13:48.040 --> 00:13:52.080
Why did you become Yosaku's 
disciple anyway, Teppei?

00:13:52.080 --> 00:13:54.150
You've got the blood of the 
amazing Gourmet Hunter,

00:13:54.150 --> 00:13:56.020
Knocking Master Jiro running through you...

00:13:56.420 --> 00:13:58.690
Didn't you ever think of 
being a Gourmet Hunter?

00:13:59.190 --> 00:14:01.590
I respect my grandpa very highly.

00:14:01.590 --> 00:14:04.460
He used to take me hunting all 
the time when I was little.

00:14:04.460 --> 00:14:06.600
It was my dream to be a 
Gourmet Hunter like him.

00:14:07.200 --> 00:14:11.530
But one day I went with Gramps 
somewhere and had quite a shock.

00:14:13.000 --> 00:14:14.600
The land was completely dried up.

00:14:14.600 --> 00:14:16.140
The ingredients were dead.

00:14:18.510 --> 00:14:22.310
It wasn't just the scenery that shocked me,

00:14:22.310 --> 00:14:25.180
it was Gramps's face, looking 
sadder than I'd ever seen him.

00:14:26.050 --> 00:14:29.120
I guess it was a place where he had many 
memories of his friends in the past.

00:14:29.820 --> 00:14:31.750
Gramps is always grinning like a fool,

00:14:31.750 --> 00:14:33.920
and I had never seen his face so depressed.

00:14:34.620 --> 00:14:37.290
That's just how much he wanted to show me

00:14:37.290 --> 00:14:40.000
the area and the ingredients 
that used to be there...

00:14:40.760 --> 00:14:45.730
That's when I thought, "Instead of 
hunting ingredients, I'll protect them."

00:14:48.000 --> 00:14:50.040
So you became a Gourmet Reviver...

00:14:50.040 --> 00:14:52.670
There weren't enough Gourmet 
Revivers back then.

00:14:53.110 --> 00:14:55.680
And because of that, many 
ingredients were dying out.

00:14:55.680 --> 00:14:58.210
Well, my goal at first

00:14:58.210 --> 00:15:01.780
was to protect the ingredients 
my great gramps had discovered,

00:15:01.780 --> 00:15:06.550
and to release the creatures 
he'd Knocked while drunk.

00:15:07.450 --> 00:15:08.560
I see.

00:15:08.920 --> 00:15:13.160
Sounds like there was a lot of tho...se...

00:15:13.160 --> 00:15:14.160
Toriko?

00:15:14.800 --> 00:15:16.830
How are things going, Toriko?

00:15:18.070 --> 00:15:18.930
Toriko!

00:15:18.930 --> 00:15:19.970
What?

00:15:19.970 --> 00:15:21.000
Toriko!

00:15:22.340 --> 00:15:23.400
What is...

00:15:27.640 --> 00:15:30.040
If something else happens, come back anytime.

00:15:30.040 --> 00:15:33.580
Although I don't think you'll 
be coming back again.

00:15:34.480 --> 00:15:36.580
Komatsu-kun, don't forget this.

00:15:36.580 --> 00:15:41.090
We chefs are always chosen 
by the ingredients.

00:15:41.620 --> 00:15:43.860
Cock your ears carefully...

00:15:43.860 --> 00:15:47.960
The voice of the ingredients will 
surely lead you to the correct answer.

00:15:47.960 --> 00:15:53.830
The ingredients have already led 
you along, and told you the way.

00:15:53.830 --> 00:15:56.870
The ingredients have... told me the way?

00:15:56.870 --> 00:15:59.610
Hurry and go! Get cooking!

00:15:59.610 --> 00:16:02.910
Make the true Century Soup!

00:16:03.840 --> 00:16:05.540
Right! I'll do my best!

00:16:09.450 --> 00:16:12.920
I can't believe he's already 
come so close to completing it.

00:16:12.920 --> 00:16:17.860
I think it must have taken me 
almost 10 years to come this far.

00:16:17.860 --> 00:16:19.860
But going through all 
those hardships out there,

00:16:19.860 --> 00:16:22.090
and seeing the true face 
of the ingredients...

00:16:22.090 --> 00:16:25.960
The effect of tasting that 
experience must be huge!

00:16:25.960 --> 00:16:29.600
That's the big difference 
between Komatsu-kun and me...

00:16:29.600 --> 00:16:33.440
Perhaps I should have continued on the 
journey, even though it was dangerous.

00:16:33.440 --> 00:16:36.710
The feeling of working hard 
to obtain something...

00:16:37.910 --> 00:16:39.180
Jiro-chan...

00:16:42.450 --> 00:16:45.580
I tasted that after all this time!

00:16:46.750 --> 00:16:48.450
W-What's going on?

00:16:48.450 --> 00:16:49.920
Perfect timing.

00:16:49.920 --> 00:16:52.020
You're already to this stage.

00:16:52.020 --> 00:16:53.990
The progression is really moving quickly.

00:16:54.560 --> 00:16:56.660
Teppei, a Nail Needle!

00:16:56.660 --> 00:16:57.690
Coming right up!

00:16:58.830 --> 00:17:00.700
W-What the hell...

00:17:00.700 --> 00:17:02.330
...is happening?!

00:17:02.330 --> 00:17:04.700
It's a side effect of the Regeneration Seed.

00:17:04.700 --> 00:17:07.770
Your body is going to develop 
a whole bunch of symptoms now.

00:17:07.770 --> 00:17:09.470
You're just going to have 
to grin and bear it.

00:17:09.670 --> 00:17:14.740
Medicine Bee (Insect Beast) Capture Level 23

00:17:10.010 --> 00:17:11.840
I'll treat you with Medicine Bees.

00:17:12.240 --> 00:17:14.880
They have medicine that'll keep 
all kinds of symptoms in check.

00:17:14.880 --> 00:17:16.880
Get motivated, Toriko!

00:17:16.880 --> 00:17:20.980
I'll do everything I can, but it's up 
to your physical and mental stamina.

00:17:20.980 --> 00:17:23.920
If you lose your focus just 
for a second, you'll die.

00:17:25.590 --> 00:17:26.660
Toriko!

00:17:26.660 --> 00:17:28.490
Hell if I'm going to lose!

00:17:28.490 --> 00:17:31.490
Komatsu is making the Century 
Soup and waiting for me!

00:17:31.490 --> 00:17:33.660
I'm gonna live through this, no matter what!

00:17:35.060 --> 00:17:37.070
I don't have enough Medicine Bees!

00:17:39.970 --> 00:17:41.670
The voice of the ingredients...

00:17:45.140 --> 00:17:46.940
Cartilage Cabbage...

00:17:46.940 --> 00:17:48.540
I think this'll give a good flavor.

00:17:49.310 --> 00:17:51.710
Let's try soaking Only Nuts for one minute.

00:17:53.580 --> 00:17:56.050
Pork Potato in Stew Wine...

00:18:00.360 --> 00:18:03.420
It's a Broth Pelican with a 
beak filled with dried bonito!

00:18:03.420 --> 00:18:05.030
There are plenty of bonito flakes in there!

00:18:06.590 --> 00:18:09.400
The voice of the ingredients!

00:18:20.110 --> 00:18:21.740
Finally, I've gotten this far...

00:18:22.040 --> 00:18:23.840
A translucent soup!

00:18:28.950 --> 00:18:33.520
I've finally caught up to 
Setsuno-san's Century Soup...

00:18:36.590 --> 00:18:38.660
But now comes the real battle.

00:18:39.290 --> 00:18:42.700
I have to find the ingredient to put 
the finishing touches on the soup!

00:18:49.500 --> 00:18:51.200
Spatula!

00:18:58.010 --> 00:18:59.710
How many of them are there?

00:19:03.420 --> 00:19:04.980
Endorphin Smoke!

00:19:19.800 --> 00:19:22.330
Rin! That was quite beautiful, for you.

00:19:22.330 --> 00:19:23.840
Let's hurry and bring them back!

00:19:28.510 --> 00:19:31.010
Master, isn't he in danger?

00:19:31.010 --> 00:19:33.240
I don't have enough Medicine Bees!

00:19:33.240 --> 00:19:35.210
I've never seen side effects this bad!

00:19:36.250 --> 00:19:39.050
His body can't keep up with 
the speed of the regeneration!

00:19:39.050 --> 00:19:41.820
He's going to lose to 
his own Gourmet Cells...

00:19:41.820 --> 00:19:43.050
We're finally back!

00:19:44.360 --> 00:19:46.990
Sorry, it took way longer than we'd hoped.

00:19:47.860 --> 00:19:49.660
Toriko, hang in there!

00:19:49.660 --> 00:19:51.330
Alright! Great job!

00:19:51.330 --> 00:19:52.630
Brace yourself, Toriko.

00:19:52.630 --> 00:19:54.070
Just a little longer!

00:19:57.700 --> 00:20:01.110
Finally, he's only one more 
step from completing the soup.

00:20:01.110 --> 00:20:03.340
But without finding the final ingredient,

00:20:03.340 --> 00:20:06.340
Chef Komatsu's exhaustion and 
fatigue have reached their peak!

00:20:06.340 --> 00:20:08.210
Even though I'm in the room next door,

00:20:08.210 --> 00:20:10.350
I can sense the anguish the chef is feeling!

00:20:10.350 --> 00:20:13.580
Will he really be able to 
complete the Century Soup?

00:20:14.820 --> 00:20:16.120
What is it?

00:20:28.570 --> 00:20:29.670
It's no good.

00:20:29.670 --> 00:20:33.100
I can't even fathom what the 
final ingredient could be.

00:20:36.040 --> 00:20:38.440
Oh, sorry to keep making you wait.

00:20:39.210 --> 00:20:40.840
You're hungry, aren't you?

00:20:40.840 --> 00:20:43.650
It's not finished yet, but 
would you like to try it?

00:21:16.510 --> 00:21:18.080
Sabrina

00:21:19.150 --> 00:21:21.320
Pa-pa-pa-para

00:21:21.680 --> 00:21:23.150
Sabrina

00:21:25.090 --> 00:21:32.260
Rainy day, dancing down on the night city

00:21:32.260 --> 00:21:39.130
I put deep red lipstick on

00:21:39.130 --> 00:21:42.900
Like toying with you

00:21:42.900 --> 00:21:46.370
Like tasting you

00:21:46.370 --> 00:21:53.450
That solitary figure seen through the glass

00:21:53.450 --> 00:22:00.190
One day, one day... Search for true love

00:22:00.190 --> 00:22:07.260
Even if hurt by the lies going around town

00:22:07.260 --> 00:22:12.030
Rottening fruit

00:22:12.030 --> 00:22:13.570
Sabrina

00:22:17.540 --> 00:22:19.370
Gourmet News!

00:22:21.740 --> 00:22:23.410
I'm your host, Tina!

00:22:23.410 --> 00:22:27.180
The eggs of the Spiny Eel, which 
give the most excellent soup stock,

00:22:27.180 --> 00:22:28.750
look surprisingly like salmon roe!

00:22:28.750 --> 00:22:33.320
So this time I'll show you all how to 
easily recreate the taste of salmon roe!

00:22:33.320 --> 00:22:36.390
If you wrap an orange slice in 
nori and dip it in soy sauce,

00:22:36.390 --> 00:22:39.730
it'll taste like a piece of salmon roe sushi!

00:22:42.960 --> 00:22:44.660
It really is like salmon roe!

00:22:44.660 --> 00:22:45.960
What a heaping helping of illusion!

00:22:45.960 --> 00:22:47.330
Simple, don't you think?

00:22:47.330 --> 00:22:48.930
Cheap, too!

00:22:48.930 --> 00:22:51.900
I bet you're thinking I'll say something 
like "It's roe in fat, too!", huh?

00:22:51.900 --> 00:22:54.240
Well, I'm not going to, got it?

00:22:54.240 --> 00:22:55.870
I'd never stoop that low.

00:22:56.770 --> 00:22:58.540
I'd never stoop that roe...

00:22:59.140 --> 00:23:00.410
Roe...

00:23:00.850 --> 00:23:01.680
No?

00:23:02.980 --> 00:23:04.980
Now, on to the next story...

00:23:06.980 --> 00:23:09.050
Next is the exclusive you've been waiting for!

00:23:09.050 --> 00:23:11.360
This soup opens the door to a new world of flavor!

00:23:13.510 --> 00:23:16.160
To the World of Ultimate Bliss! Taste the Century Soup!

00:23:16.680 --> 00:23:18.350
Look forward to another heaping helping of fun!
